Hanks plays a FedEx troubleshooter who is stranded on a deserted island after his plane crashes in the
South Pacific, and the plot focuses on his desperate attempts to survive and return home.

17
01:41:17,500 --> 01:41:23,500
Filming took place from January to March 1999, and April to May 2000.

18
01:47:15,000 --> 01:47:21,000
